# ---- Tool scratch directory ----
# `tsx` and node's compile cache write here (`node-compile-cache/`,
# `tsx-*/`) whenever a script is run from `respin/`. It was untracked AND
# un-ignored, so `git status` listed `?? respin/.tmp/` beside the real source
# files of an entirely-untracked slice — one `git add -A` from being committed
# (code review round 1, C14; verified with `git check-ignore --no-index`).
.tmp/

# ---- Test PROBE ARTIFACTS (planted violations — never committable) ----
# A non-vacuity test proves its source scan is not silently broken by WRITING a
# real violation into the tree it is about to scan and asserting the scan finds
# it. Every one of those files is a genuine defect while it exists — the app/
# probes import trustWorkspaceId, the __*_probe.ts files forge a branded id or
# register a forged scope in the cage — and slice 6 found one on disk after an
# interrupted run, untracked and committable by `git add -A`.
#
# The list is tests/support/probe-artifacts.ts (PROBE_GITIGNORE_PATTERNS pins
# these lines; tests/probe-artifacts.test.ts asserts the INSTALLED git
# really ignores each planted path). Ignoring them also hides them from
# `git grep --untracked`, so the scans no longer see a probe planted by a
# concurrently-running test file — and the tests that plant one name it back
# through `scanFor`'s `includeIgnored`.
# THE CONVENTION IS THE `__` PREFIX, not the `_probe` suffix (widened in the
# slice-8c fix round, C14). The three original patterns covered probes a SUITE
# plants and nothing else, so when a reviewer wrote `__rev_mut1.ts` (a mutated
# copy of the money module) into `packages/credits/src/` and
# `__rev_probe.test.ts` into its `tests/`, both were untracked, un-ignored and
# committable while they existed, and `isolation.test.ts` was red for reasons
# no one could see in the tree. Any file whose NAME starts with `__` is scratch
# — a planted probe, a mutant, a reviewer's aliased copy — and is never product
# code; nothing in this repo starts a real filename that way.
__scan_probe__/
__stripe_scan_probe__/
__*.ts
__*.tsx

# ---- Playwright e2e journey evidence (respin-engineer, 2026-09-05) ----
# Screenshots/console logs are per-run evidence, not source; test-results/ and
# playwright-report/ are the runner's own scratch output.
e2e/journeys/artifacts/
test-results/
playwright-report/
